# Linksys SPNMX56 vs Plusnet Hub Two: Which Router Is Better?

As part of our move from **Plusnet** to **Toob full‑fibre broadband**, I wanted to compare the router we’ve been using (the **Plusnet Hub Two**) with the **Linksys SPNMX56** that Toob supplies. This comparison covers Wi‑Fi performance, security, mesh capability, and even the Ethernet cabling differences — including the fact that Toob’s Cat6 cable colour actually matches their branding.

